WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.520
繁华都市的阴影下 狼人家族掌控着一切
Beneath the city, werewolf bloodlines rule.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.810
传说每只狼，生来只有一个 Mate。
They say every wolf is born with one Mate.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.520
纯血 Alpha 族长 Magnus Thorne 寻找命定伴侣三十年
Alpha Magnus Thorne has searched 30 years for his Mate.

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.120
我找了她三十年。
I searched for mine for thirty years.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.520
今晚，他将宣布 一场没有爱情的政治联姻
Tonight, he announces a loveless political marriage.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.630
今晚，我不找了……为了血统，我会结婚。
Tonight, I stop searching... and marry for the bloodline.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.250
直到她的气味闯了进来……
Until her scent found him...

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.630
午夜车库
MIDNIGHT GARAGE

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:27.125
第 1 集 · 午夜车库
Episode 1 · Midnight Garage

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:28.075
每个夜晚，他都梦见同一个 看不清脸的女人
Every night, he dreams of a woman whose face he never sees.

00:00:28.825 --> 00:00:32.895
每个夜晚……同样的气味，同样的影子。你到底是谁？
Every night... the same scent. The same shadow. Who are you?

00:00:36.575 --> 00:00:40.955
又是那个梦……我大概是最近太累了。
That dream again... I must be more tired than I thought.

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:52.625
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:57.025 --> 00:00:57.975
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:58.425 --> 00:00:59.695
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:59.709 --> 00:01:01.909
你选择了：放开我。你是谁？
Let go of me. Who are you?

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.079
你：
Let go of me. Who are you?

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:06.589
Magnus Thorne。该你了。
Magnus Thorne. Now you.

00:01:07.384 --> 00:01:11.274
你：我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
I'm the event photographer. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:01:11.514 --> 00:01:12.764
摄影师。
A photographer.

00:01:13.194 --> 00:01:14.464
你是来拍我订婚的。
You came to shoot my engagement.

00:01:15.054 --> 00:01:16.844
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:01:17.414 --> 00:01:18.264
待着。
Stay.

00:01:20.324 --> 00:01:23.824
Thorne 先生，Harland 把订婚宣布提前了。
Mr. Thorne. Harland moved the engagement announcement up.

00:01:23.904 --> 00:01:25.614
还有十分钟。您在哪？
Ten minutes. Where are you?

00:01:25.824 --> 00:01:27.044
Luca，关掉车库监控。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras.

00:01:27.124 --> 00:01:28.874
三分钟，谁也别下来。
Three minutes. Nobody comes down.

00:01:34.904 --> 00:01:36.694
让我……就一次。
Let me… once.

00:01:36.964 --> 00:01:38.854
我得确认你是真的。
I need to know you're real.

00:01:38.918 --> 00:01:41.118
你选择了：不行。先告诉我，你到底是什么。
No. First tell me what you are.

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:41.288
你：
No. First tell me what you are.

00:01:43.488 --> 00:01:50.488
你们故事里从没写对的东西。……跟我走，剩下的我告诉你。
Something your stories never got right. … Come with me. I'll tell you the rest.

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:53.313
你：抱歉，我还有工作。
Sorry. I have work to do.

00:01:54.103 --> 00:01:56.663
封锁出口。这一层，谁也不准离开。
Lock the exits. Nobody leaves this level.

00:01:56.743 --> 00:01:58.863
你：你这是在……绑架我？
Are you… kidnapping me?

00:01:58.943 --> 00:02:01.663
我不是在抓你，我是在保护你。
I'm not taking you. I'm keeping you safe.

00:02:03.933 --> 00:02:05.383
先生……您的眼睛。
Sir… your eyes.

00:02:05.463 --> 00:02:07.663
封锁监控，清掉酒店的记录。
Seal the cameras. Wipe the hotel's records.

00:02:07.743 --> 00:02:09.933
查清她是谁，还有她今晚为什么会在这里。
Find out who she is — and why she was here tonight.

00:02:10.013 --> 00:02:10.903
是，Alpha。
Yes, Alpha.

00:02:11.877 --> 00:02:14.377
第 2 集 · 车厢里的克制
Episode 2 · The Car

00:02:12.177 --> 00:02:16.097
你：好，我跟你走。但路上，你得把话说清楚。
Fine. I'll come. But you explain on the way.

00:02:18.457 --> 00:02:19.997
开车。
Drive.

00:02:20.077 --> 00:02:22.597
你：你还没告诉我，你到底是什么。
You still haven't told me what you are.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.387
现在，我身上全是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:02:26.897 --> 00:02:29.207
午夜之前，那家酒店里的每一头狼都会知道。
Every wolf in that hotel will know it by midnight.

00:02:30.137 --> 00:02:31.987
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:02:36.857 --> 00:02:39.147
现在别碰我……我会停不下来。
Don't touch me right now… I won't be able to stop.

00:02:39.227 --> 00:02:39.437
你：你不会伤害我的。
You won't hurt me.

00:02:39.437 --> 00:02:41.037
你：你不会伤害我的。
You won't hurt me.

00:02:39.437 --> 00:02:41.637
你选择了：（把手覆在他的拳头上）你不会伤害我的。
(Lay your hand over his fist.) You won't hurt me.

00:02:51.907 --> 00:02:54.097
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:02:54.787 --> 00:02:55.697
让他们来。
Let them.

00:03:01.257 --> 00:03:03.757
第 3 集 · 他的领地
Episode 3 · His Territory

00:03:11.617 --> 00:03:13.577
是我的气味。在这里，到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:03:13.657 --> 00:03:16.507
会好的。我……该提前告诉你。
It'll settle. I… should have warned you.

00:03:25.677 --> 00:03:27.247
这里是我的领地。
This is my territory.

00:03:28.137 --> 00:03:29.037
在这里，没人能碰你。
No one touches you here.

00:03:29.117 --> 00:03:31.137
你：你到底还瞒着我什么？
What else are you hiding?

00:03:33.087 --> 00:03:35.327
你们的世界里，只在故事里听过的东西。
Something your world only tells stories about.

00:03:35.407 --> 00:03:39.557
而你……是我本不该找到的那个人。
And you… are the one thing I was never meant to find.

00:03:39.927 --> 00:03:42.127
你选择了：那楼上的订婚呢？
And the engagement upstairs?

00:03:39.977 --> 00:03:42.157
你：那楼上的订婚呢？
And the engagement upstairs?

00:03:42.547 --> 00:03:45.117
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就走了。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.517
Selene 从来都不是我的。
Selene was never mine.

00:03:49.377 --> 00:03:50.227
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:03:51.886 --> 00:03:54.386
第 4 集 · 不速之客
Episode 4 · Uninvited

00:03:51.886 --> 00:03:57.366
Arkwright 小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright — he's not receiving anyone tonight.

00:03:57.446 --> 00:03:58.536
他会见我的。
He'll receive me.

00:04:06.716 --> 00:04:07.946
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:04:08.996 --> 00:04:16.526
Alpha，Arkwright 小姐来了，她不肯等。
Alpha — Miss Arkwright. She wouldn't wait.

00:04:16.606 --> 00:04:17.456
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:04:18.806 --> 00:04:20.816
她轮不到你过问，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:04:21.846 --> 00:04:23.096
一个人类，Magnus？
A human, Magnus?

00:04:23.706 --> 00:04:25.656
满月之前，长老会会把她带走。
The Council will have her before the full moon.

00:04:28.136 --> 00:04:30.336
你选择了：（走向他）我不是在怕你。
(Walk to him.) I'm not afraid of you.

00:04:28.136 --> 00:04:30.636
第 5 集 · 不想逃
Episode 5 · I Don't Want to Run

00:04:31.286 --> 00:04:33.156
你：我不是在怕你。
I'm not afraid of you.

00:04:37.726 --> 00:04:38.936
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:04:39.595 --> 00:04:41.795
你选择了：我好像……并不想逃。
I don't think… I want to run.

00:04:39.645 --> 00:04:42.625
你：我好像……并不想逃。
I don't think… I want to run.

00:04:47.245 --> 00:04:48.215
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:04:56.345 --> 00:04:59.335
你：你为了我……放弃了一切？
You walked away from all of it… for me?

00:04:59.415 --> 00:05:02.465
再来一次，我还是会这么做……每一次都会。
I'd do it again… every time.

00:05:06.195 --> 00:05:09.515
找了三十年……她终于在我怀里了。
Thirty years of searching... and she's finally in my arms.

00:05:11.395 --> 00:05:13.195
你：那就别放手。
Then don't let go.

00:05:15.845 --> 00:05:18.895
你：你今晚不是该订婚吗？
Weren't you supposed to be getting engaged tonight?

00:05:18.975 --> 00:05:21.705
本来是。直到今晚。
I was. Until tonight.

00:05:22.275 --> 00:05:24.025
我改主意了。
I changed my mind.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.670
你选择了：（勾住他的后颈，吻上去）
(Pull him in and kiss him.)

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.970
第 6 集 · 今夜
Episode 6 · Tonight

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:33.040
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.290
你：我哪儿也不去。
I'm not going anywhere.

00:06:02.512 --> 00:06:05.012
第 7 集 · 长老会
Episode 7 · The Council

00:06:02.512 --> 00:06:05.182
Alpha，Harland 召集了长老。
Alpha. Harland has called the elders.

00:06:05.532 --> 00:06:08.162
他们要你把她交给长老会，就在今晚。
They demand you hand her over to the Council. Tonight.

00:06:10.592 --> 00:06:12.382
那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:06:12.554 --> 00:06:14.754
你选择了：那我跟你一起去。
Then I'm coming with you.

00:06:12.854 --> 00:06:14.774
你：那我跟你一起去。
Then I'm coming with you.

00:06:17.614 --> 00:06:21.844
把她交出来，Magnus。族规比你古老。
Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:06:24.804 --> 00:06:28.574
那这条族规，今晚就到此为止。她是我的 Mate。
Then the law ends tonight. She is my Mate.

00:06:28.664 --> 00:06:32.014
那你就是在向自己的血脉宣战。
Then you have declared war on your own blood.

00:06:33.304 --> 00:06:34.514
那就如此。
So be it.

00:06:35.044 --> 00:06:38.244
第一集 · 完 未完待续
Episode 1 · To be continued
